    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source Swedish ICD-10-SE 7-character extension of ICD-10 V87.1 (collision between other motor
        vehicle and two- or three-wheeled motor vehicle, traffic), subclassified by activity = SNOMED CT
        274913009 36198007. The activity dimension is not separately coded in SNOMED CT. Target SNOMED CT
        433930 = (event concept); target SNOMED CT 444074 = (status/victim concept). The parent ICD-10
        V87.1 has an Athena crosswalk to both targets; the SE extension adds only an activity suffix
        with no separate SNOMED CT representation, so the parent crosswalk applies unchanged. Why these
        targets: both are the verified standard crosswalk targets of the parent code; no narrower SNOMED CT
        concept distinguishes the activity. Why this tier: verified crosswalk in the local mirror with a
        small, well-understood breadth mismatch (activity dimension lost) = high. Both targets are
        broader than the source.
        """
}
